DESCRIPTION:Jay Gardiner is having a whale of a bad day. While diving off 
 the California coast to recover his late father’s remains\, he gets swal
 lowed whole by an 80-foot sperm whale and has one hour of oxygen to escape
 . Austin Abrams\, currently having a major moment after starring in Zach C
 regger’s RESIDENT EVIL\, leads this adaptation of Daniel Kraus’ bestse
 lling novel. Yes\, it’s a movie where a guy gets swallowed by a whale\, 
 but it’s also a tense and even moving tale of survival\, grief\, and fam
 ily. Dive in on the big screen.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/11/3/whalefall-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
