DESCRIPTION:David Lynch blends together southern gothic melodrama\, THE WI
 ZARD OF OZ\, surreal kinky violence\, and Elvis in this nightmare soap ope
 ra thrill ride.\n\nBased on the pulp novel by author Barry Gifford\, WILD 
 AT HEART follows outlaw lovers Sailor (Nicolas Cage) and Lula (Laura Dern)
  as they go on the run through a menacing Deep South\, populated by the us
 ual stable of unsettling Lynchian weirdos (including a bonkers Willem Dafo
 e). Funny\, scary\, and brilliantly cinematic\, Lynch received the Palme d
 ’Or for this film at Cannes amid “the most violent chorus of boos and 
 hisses to be heard in a decade.” Strap in.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.
 com/events/2026/11/3/wild-at-heart-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
