BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with Jane Schoenbrun: Public Access Afterworld + I Saw 
 the TV Glow
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T200000
DTSTAMP:20261105T110617Z
UID:dothebay-17846157@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Co-presented by Book Passage.\n\nJoin us for a special evening
  with acclaimed filmmaker and writer Jane Schoenbrun\, celebrating the rel
 ease of their debut novel\, Public Access Afterworld.\n\nSchoenbrun will j
 oin us for a moderated conversation about the book and their work\, follow
 ed by a screening of their acclaimed film I Saw the TV Glow.\n\nA mesmeriz
 ing mash-up of speculative fiction\, horror\, and conspiracy\, Public Acce
 ss Afterworld spans decades and realities\, following an unforgettable ens
 emble of outsiders drawn into the mystery of a strange pirate television n
 etwork broadcasting from somewhere beyond the static.\n\nTicket includes a
  pre-signed copy of Public Access Afterworld. Additional books will be ava
 ilable for purchase at the event.\n\nAbout Public Access Afterworld\n\n“
 Beautiful\, funny\, and scathing… I stayed up all night binge-reading.
 ” – SenLinYu\n\n“Psychedelic horror of the first order.” – Grady
  Hendrix\n\n“Heart-wrenching\, hilarious\, visionary\, and so damned sma
 rt\, this novel is a major work by a major writer.” -Paul Tremblay\n\n
 “Dazzling and politically acute\, Schoenbrun’s debut announces a major
  literary voice.” – Kirkus Reviews (starred review)\n\nOne of Publishe
 rs Weekly’s 10 Most Anticipated Books. One of the Most Anticipated Books
  of the Year: Lit Hub\, The Chicago Review of Books\, The Bookseller\, Rea
 ctor\, Library Journal\, and Debutiful.\n\nFind the receiver. Make it real
 .\n\nAt 5:35 p.m. on September 3\, 1988. Dallas weatherman Ray “Can You 
 Say Sunshine” Davino makes passing r...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com
 /events/2026/11/4/an-evening-with-jane-schoenbrun-public-access-afterworld
 -i-saw-the-tv-glow-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34437282/19e24993-68f3-4e61-a54c-99ccb1c23f2d.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T110617Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/4/an-evening-with-jane-schoenbrun-
 public-access-afterworld-i-saw-the-tv-glow-tickets
END:VEVENT
