 et/35146276/e4116d42-be68-4ad4-986e-fae6bbed2bd1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T110227Z
LOCATION:AMC Kabuki 8\, 1881 Post St.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/el-sett-opening-night-of-the-30t
 h-arab-film-festival-tickets
