BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Filmscreening: Millennial Punk: Episodes 3 & 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T200000
DTSTAMP:20261103T193658Z
UID:funcheap-1639681@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer© SWRWe’re screening the fi
 nal two episodes of Millennial Punk – Eine Subkultur in Zeiten der Digit
 alisierung\, Diana Ringelsiep and Felix Bundschuh’s four-part documentar
 y series on the punk scene of the 1990s and early 2000s.\nThe series was m
 ade in 2024. Musicians\, journalists and activists from the scene look bac
 k on a time when punk was often written off as a thing of the past. Beyond
  the music\, the series explores punk’s lasting ties to anti-discriminat
 ion\, anti-fascism and diversity\, and asks what it takes to keep Punk’s
  not dead! alive in an increasingly digital world.\n\nEpisodes 1 and 2\, f
 ollowed by a conversation with the filmmakers\, screen on November 4.\n\nF
