DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Tech InteractiveHumanity s
 urvived once. Can it survive again?\nGodzilla returns to the big screen in
  Godzilla Minus Zero\, the highly anticipated sequel to the Academy Award-
 winning Godzilla Minus One. Experience the terror\, towering destruction\,
  and heart-pounding action like never before in The Tech Interactive’s I
 MAX® Dome Theater.\nTwo years after Godzilla devastated an already war-to
 rn Japan\, the country is finally beginning to rebuild. Families have recl
 aimed their lives\, hope is returning\, and peace seems within reach.\n\nT
 hen\, a new threat emerges\, threatening to destroy everything humanity ha
 s fought to recover.\nThere is no third time. Everything ends here.\nFrom 
 acclaimed director Takashi Yamazaki\, Godzilla Minus Zero is the first Jap
 anese production in the Filmed For IMAX® program\, created with IMAX-cert
 ified cameras and optimized for a larger-than-life cinematic experience.\n
 Why See It at The Tech Interactive?\n– Go bigger with Godzilla: Experien
 ce the legendary monster on the largest dome screen in the Bay Area\, wher
 e every earth-shaking moment feels monumental.\n– Feel the roar: IMAX wi
 th Laser delivers breathtaking clarity\, vivid visuals\, and crystal-clear
  sound that puts you in the middle of the action.\n– Experience it as in
 tended: Filmed For IMAX®\, this epic adventure brings Godzilla’s terrif
 ying scale and cinematic spectacle to life in an unforgettable way.\nWheth
 er you’re a lifelong Godzilla fan or discovering the legendary monster..
 .\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/169378/t/tickets\nDe
 tails: https://sf.funcheap.com/godzilla-imax-tech-interactive/\nSource: Fu
 ncheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Godzil
 la-Minus.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T193658Z
LOCATION:The Tech Interactive 201 S. Market St. San Jose\, CA 95113
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/godzilla-imax-tech-interactive/
