SUMMARY:New People: Closure
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T203000
DTSTAMP:20261106T110227Z
UID:dothebay-17939702@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:All listed screenings take place at NEW PEOPLE CINEMA\, locate
 d at 1746 Post Street in Japantown.\n\nFilmmaker Michał Marczak in person
  for a post screening Q&A.\n\nAfter his teenage son\, Chris\, is last seen
  by a surveillance camera on a bridge over Warsaw’s turbulent Vistula Ri
 ver\, Daniel embarks on an all-consuming search. Armed with self-built boa
 ts\, drones\, and underwater cameras\, he relentlessly scours the river’
 s depths. As months pass\, while his own family struggles to live with the
  uncertainty of Chris’s disappearance\, Daniel begins helping other fami
 lies with missing loved ones find answers — and\, at times\, the closure
  that continues to elude him.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 48m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDire
 ctor\n\nMichal Marczak\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nPoland and France\n\
 nLanguage\n\nPolish with English subtitles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 5\
 , 2026\n\nCategories\n\nNew People Cinema\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/new-people-closure-tickets\nSource: Do
 TheBay
