BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:$25 Encore Screening: “El Sett” + Umm Kulthum’s Story
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T221500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T011500
DTSTAMP:20261103T193658Z
UID:funcheap-1645000@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerImage courtesy of Watermelon P
 icturesThe 30th Arab Film Festival opens on Thursday November 5th with El 
 Sett\, Marwan Hamed’s sweeping cinematic portrait of legendary Egyptian 
 singer Umm Kulthum\, one of the most celebrated and influential artists in
  the history of the Arab world.\nThe 6 pm Opening Night screening is almos
 t sold out\, so we opened an Encore Screening for all night owls who want 
 to watch El Sett!\n\nPLEASE NOTE: The Encore Screening is offered at a red
 uced price because it includes only the movie (there won’t be a program 
 before or a performance after)\nYou are invited to join us in your best at
 tire\, just like you would have dressed to see Umm Kulthum perform at her 
 legendary 1967 performance at Paris’s Olympia! Let’s transform the eve
 ning into a memorable tribute to the most iconic Arab singer of all times.
 \nAbout EL SETT\nStarring Mona Zaki as Umm Kulthum\, the film traces her e
 xtraordinary journey from a childhood singing in rural Egypt\, where she p
 erformed disguised as a boy\, to her rise as the Arab world’s most iconi
 c voice. The story culminates around her historic 1967 performance at Pari
 s’s Olympia\, while exploring the ambition\, sacrifice\, resilience\, an
 d defiance of social conventions that shaped her remarkable life.\nMore th
 an the story of a musical legend\, El Sett is a portrait of a woman whose 
 voice became inseparable from the cultural and political life of a generat
 ion. Its themes of artistic power\, female ambition\, identity\, a...\n\n$
 25.00\n\nTickets: https://aff30.arabfilmfestival.org/schedule\nDetails: ht
 tps://sf.funcheap.com/25-encore-screening-el-sett-umm-kulthums-story-sf/\n
 Source: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/El-Set
 t-Opening-Night-AFF301.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T193658Z
LOCATION:AMC Kabuki Cinemas\, 1881 Post St\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/25-encore-screening-el-sett-umm-kulthums-story
 -sf/
END:VEVENT
