SUMMARY:Southland Tales
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T151500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T171500
DTSTAMP:20261108T061419Z
UID:dothebay-17979569@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Writer-director Richard Kelly goes down the road not taken in 
 his follow-up to DONNIE DARKO. Ahead of its time and more relevant than ev
 er\, SOUTHLAND TALES returns to the big screen as a triumphant cult classi
 c!\n\nIn a dark world where Texas is destroyed by nuclear war\, the future
  becomes more futuristic than scientists predicted. In the dystopian parad
 ise of Southern California\, an action star has amnesia\, an adult film st
 ar goes mainstream with reality TV\, and a cop uncovers deep trouble. Soun
 d familiar? SOUTHLAND TALES takes all this and blows up the chemical equil
 ibrium in your brain!\n\nDwayne “The Rock” Johnson! Sara Michelle Gell
 ar! Justin Timberlake! Mandy Moore! Sean William Scott! Pop stars! Teen ic
 ons! Former wrestlers! Jon Lovitz? SOUTHLAND TALES is a surreal trip into 
 the near future!\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/7/southla
 nd-tales-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
