SUMMARY:Rock Ross: Go Like This (16mm)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T200000
DTSTAMP:20261024T160225Z
UID:dothebay-17988720@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Canyon Cinema\n\nFilmmaker Rock Ross in person fo
 r a post-screening audience Q&A!\n\nCanyon at The Roxie is back with a spo
 tlight on local legend Charles Rock Ross! Rock Ross: Go Like This surveys 
 20 years of the filmmaker’s “frivolous and socially irresponsible film
 s” (The Athens News)\, bringing together 16mm prints and camera original
 s from the Academy Film Archive and Canyon Cinema collections.\n\nThe long
 time Bay Area independent filmmaker\, musician\, and organizer has been cr
 afting wryly exuberant\, riotous work since the early-1970s. After receivi
 ng his BFA and MFA in Filmmaking from the San Francisco Art Institute\, Ro
 ss worked as Film Inspector and Shipper for the Canyon Cinema Co-op from 1
 975 to 1978\, Editing Facility Manager for Film Arts Foundation from 1982 
 to 1986\, and in 1988\, served as Director of the Ann Arbor Film Festival.
  As a founding member and projectionist of the No Nothing Cinema (1982-199
 7) and New Nothing Cinema (1997-2017)\, Ross has screened thousands of ind
 ependent and experimental films and videos. As a title designer\, from 197
 8 to 2013\, Ross designed thousands of titles for independent films\, shoo
 ting directly on film using his own animation stand. He has also scored a 
 number of films with his band\, The Goat Family\, which formed in 2003.\n\
 n“Film as art has no bounds… For me its potential is as exciting as pu
 re white noise.” – Rock Ross\n\nScreening Line-up:\n\nSosueme (Rock Ro
 ss\, 1988\, 6.5 minutes\, b&w\, sound\, 16mm)\n\nTill My Head Caves In (Ro
 ck Ro...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22387?sit
 eToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/20
 26/11/11/rock-ross-go-like-this-16mm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35107373/cd53fce5-165c-4aba-a4fe-764d3737a197.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261024T160225Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/11/rock-ross-go-like-this-16mm-tic
 kets
END:VEVENT
