CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:We love a good heist movie\, especially when the getaway is as
  stylish as the score. In HOW TO ROB A BANK\, JOHN WICK director David Lei
 tch brings his kinetic action sensibilities to a crew of social media-savv
 y robbers (Nicholas Hoult\, Pete Davidson) who broadcast their daring heis
 ts for the world to see. But viral fame attracts the wrong kind of attenti
 on\, and a veteran FBI agent (John C. Reilly) and a brilliant software eng
 ineer (Zoë Kravitz) are closing in. Assemble your wolfpack and catch this
  one on the big screen.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/how-to-
 rob-a-bank?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=23309\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/ev
 ents/2026/11/11/how-to-rob-a-bank-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
