BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women on the Verge of a Nervous Breakdown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T213000
DTSTAMP:20261023T171442Z
UID:dothebay-17979574@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Even in his darkest films\, Pedro Almodóvar never shies away 
 from peppering whimsy and fun into his explorations of the fringes of the 
 human psyche. With his 1988 classic WOMEN ON THE VERGE OF A NERVOUS BREAKD
 OWN\, he delightfully flips that equation\, resulting in a hugely funny an
 d whimsical film that lightly peppers human insight throughout.\n\nActress
  Pepa Marcos (Carmen Maura\, MATADOR) is\, well\, on the verge of a nervou
 s breakdown. Having been abandoned by her lover\, she embarks on a quest t
 o reestablish contact with him\, all the while navigating the stresses of 
 live animals\, answering machines\, apartment fires\, a girlfriend with ac
 cidental ties to terrorism\, her ex-lover’s son (Antonio Banderas\, PAIN
  AND GLORY)\, sleeping pills\, and inquisitive detectives.\n\nWith his tra
 demark color palette\, dynamic camerawork\, and a virtuoso performance fro
 m Carmen Maura in the lead role\, WOMEN ON THE VERGE OF A NERVOUS BREAKDOW
 N takes the pain of heartbreak and wrings every last laugh out of it.\n\nT
 ickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/women-on-the-verge-of-a-nervous-bre
 akdown?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22949\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/11/12/women-on-the-verge-of-a-nervous-breakdown-tickets\nSource: DoT
 heBay
GEO:37.7562198;-122.419185
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35067942/97d6f195-f5e2-4b8f-8029-169ca1cf2347.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T171442Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/women-on-the-verge-of-a-nervous
 -breakdown-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free “Arab Film Festival” Outdoor Movie Night at The Proxy (Ha
 yes Valley)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261112T210000
DTSTAMP:20261023T050002Z
UID:funcheap-1643767@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Image from the Arab Film FestivalAn Evening of Love and Laught
 er: Arab Cinema Under the Stars\nA FREE Outdoor Screening at The PROXY\, H
 ayes Valley Neighborhood\, San Francisco\nFor the first time ever\, the Ar
 ab Film Festival celebrates its 30 year anniversary by taking cinema outdo
 ors! Join us under the stars for Spices and Lies (La Petite Cuisine de Meh
 di)\, directed by Amine Adjina\, and starring Hiam Abbas\, a delightful Fr
 ench-Algerian romantic comedy served with love\, laughter\, family dynamic
 s\, cultural identity\, and\, of course\, food. Who can miss that!\n\nGrab
  a Jeeroz warm Shawarma and hot cajun fries or savor golden sweet Kunafa f
 rom SimSim Kunafa\, as we enjoy a story that reminds us how much we have i
 n common\, no matter what language we speak.\nImagine the magic of a Europ
 ean film festival\, think Piazza Grande at the Locarno Film Festival in Sw
 itzerland\; or the Tribeca Film Festival in New York with their outdoor sc
 reening at the Hudson Yards\, where cinema brings people together under th
 e night sky. Do you remember the communal spirit of Cinema Paradiso: a liv
 ely plaza \, a big screen beneath the stars and a community gathering to s
 hare the joy of film. On Thursday\, November 12th at 7:30pm\, you and your
 s can experience that magic right here in the heart of Hayes Valley in San
  Francisco!\nBring your friends\, your colleagues and your family and find
  your spot\, and enjoy an evening of a foreign film\, delicious street foo
 d\, and shared laughter with love.Free admission. Great food....\n\nFree\n
 \nTickets: https://aff30.arabfilmfestival.org/events#under-the-stars\nDeta
 ils: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-arab-film-festival-outdoor-movie-night-p
 roxy-hayes-valley/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AFF-20
 26-Official-Selections-Features.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T050002Z
LOCATION:Proxy SF\, 432 Octavia St San Francisco\, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-arab-film-festival-outdoor-movie-night-pr
 oxy-hayes-valley/
END:VEVENT
