DESCRIPTION:Dr. Robert Ledgard (Antonio Banderas) is a driven plastic surg
 eon haunted by personal tragedies. After many years of trial and error\, h
 e finally perfects a new skin – a shield that could have prevented the d
 eath of his wife in an accident years earlier. His latest “guinea pig”
  is a mysterious captive whose true identity masks a shocking mystery. THE
  SKIN I LIVE IN is a masterful tale of secrets\, obsession\, and revenge f
 rom Oscar-winning (Best Writing and Original Screenplay for TALK TO HER) w
 riter/director Pedro Almodóvar.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/sho
 w/the-skin-i-live-in?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22954\nDetails: https://dothe
 bay.com/events/2026/11/15/the-skin-i-live-in-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
