SUMMARY:Counsellor at Law
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17866474@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Part of our series Wild\, Weird\, Wicked: Films From Before th
 e Code!\n\nDirected by the illustrious William Wyler (The Good Fairy\, The
  Big Country\, Ben-Hur)\, the briskly paced Counsellor at Law is often cit
 ed as the best film to ever tackle the intricacies and pitfalls of the leg
 al profession. George Simon (Hollywood legend John Barrymore\, Dr. Jekyll 
 and Mr. Hyde) is a successful attorney\, climbing from a Jewish ghetto to 
 elegant Art Deco offices in the Empire State Building. After allowing one 
 of his former clients to commit perjury to win a case\, George realizes he
  could be disbarred. Flavored with social commentary and wry humor\, and f
 eaturing a luminous performance by the great Bebe Daniels as George’s se
 cretary Regina\, Counsellor at Law is an exceptional example of the hard-b
 oiled dramas that defined the Pre-Code cinema of the early 1930s.\n\nRunti
 me\n\n1h 21m\n\nYear\n\n1933\n\nDirector\n\nWilliam Wyler\n\nFormat\n\nDig
 ital\n\nCountry\n\nUS\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 
 17\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nSilver Screen Club\n\nWild\, Weird\, Wicked: Fi
 lms From Before the Code\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.u
 swest.veezi.com/purchase/22054?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetai
 ls: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/17/counsellor-at-law-tickets\nSour
 ce: DoTheBay
