 \, they reunite to stop the demon once and for all when it returns to thei
 r hometown.\n\nThe two-part TV miniseries comes to the big screen courtesy
  of Basement VHS. In-person Q&A with Director Tommy Lee Wallace to follow 
 the screening. Costumes highly encouraged!\n\nBasement is an art collectiv
 e and VHS archive in the Mission District of San Francisco\, CA.\n\nThey h
 ost a weekly film screening and radio show on Radio Valencia.\n\nTickets: 
