SUMMARY:Women on the Verge of a Nervous Breakdown (35mm)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T200000
DTSTAMP:20261105T200237Z
UID:dothebay-18039093@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:This fast-paced celebration of hysteria put Almodóvar on the 
 map by joyfully parading his depthless obsession with women – especially
  the wild ones. Driven to the brink by her married lover\, Pepa (Carmen Ma
 ura) cries at work\, lights her bed on fire\, and loads the gazpacho with 
 barbiturates. Her girlfriends don’t fare much better in this melodramati
 c farce that runs at a constant parody-level soap-operatic pitch. It’s n
 o small coincidence that during filming Carmen Maura grew so angry with th
 e director she outright refused to speak to him. Men drive the women of th
 is movie to crisis – a trash collector\, Shiite terrorists\, boyfriends\
 , Antonio Banderas – and the women fight back as a series of peculiar co
 incidences tightens the social fabric of Madrid. “I thought this only ha
 ppened in the movies\,” a cab driver tells Pepa after she has him tail a
 nother cab. Yeah yeah\, her expression says\, but it’s headed somewhere 
 very interesting.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 28m\n\nYear\n\n1988\n\nDirector\n\nPedr
 o Almodóvar\n\nFormat\n\n35mm\n\nCountry\n\nSpain\n\nLanguage\n\nIn Spani
 sh with English subtitles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 28\, 2026\n\nCatego
 ries\n\nRoxCine\n\nIn the Mood for Almodóvar\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets
 : https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22470?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn
 7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/28/women-on-t
 he-verge-of-a-nervous-breakdown-35mm-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
