 et/35142567/1e0b9246-d761-4a53-a219-ff1aa055fa86.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T101008Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/29/the-shining-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:When Harry Met Sally...
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261230T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261230T210000
DTSTAMP:20261031T124306Z
UID:dothebay-17979573@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:We all know those couples. They see each other from across the
  room\, they meet\, and wham! They’re desperately in love.\n\nThat’s n
 ot the case for Harry and Sally. In fact\, when they meet\, they don’t p
 articularly like each other. Sally is earnest and good. Harry is cynical a
 nd depressive. It’s not a match made in heaven.\n\nBut lovers of rom-com
 s know that opposites have a way of attracting.\n\nWith some of the most p
 alpable on-screen chemistry in movie history\, Billy Crystal and Meg Ryan 
 take viewers on a journey through friendship\, heartbreak\, and the pitfal
 ls of relationships with the help of expert direction from Rob Reiner\, a 
 pitch-perfect supporting cast (including Carrie Fisher and Bruno Kirby)\, 
 and one of the best romantic comedy screenplays of all time from the brill
 iant Nora Ephron.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/when-harry-me
 t-sally?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22978\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/event
 s/2026/12/30/when-harry-met-sally-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7562198;-122.419185
