 et/35067922/b844838c-dfdb-46ea-81c1-52b74d195899.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261031T124306Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/30/when-harry-met-sally-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mars Attacks!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T180000
DTSTAMP:20261101T160546Z
UID:dothebay-17979580@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:How do you follow the success of gargantuan blockbusters like 
 BATMAN and BATMAN RETURNS? Well\, if you’re oddball director Tim Burton\
 , you decide to make a campy\, violent\, big-budget alien invasion comedy 
 based on a series of sci-fi trading cards from the 1960s.\n\nWith an absur
 dly star-studded cast\, including Pierce Brosnan\, Glenn Close\, Annette B
 ening\, Danny DeVito\, Michael J. Fox\, Martin Short\, Natalie Portman\, J
 ack Black\, Sarah Jessica Parker's head on a chihuahua’s body\, and Jack
  Nicholson in two different roles\, MARS ATTACKS! is a demented piece of r
 etro-pop madness that represents Tim Burton at his very best. If you've ne
 ver seen this epic\, raucously funny cult classic\, don't miss your chance
  to experience it on the big screen.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf
 /show/mars-attacks?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22979\nDetails: https://dotheba
 y.com/events/2026/12/31/mars-attacks-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7562198;-122.419185
